TH_Text_MomMorning::
    .string "MOM: You've checked your bag\n"
    .string "three times.\p"
    .string "Go on--OAK's waiting! Come home\n"
    .string "whenever you like.$"

TH_Text_BedroomSign::
    .string "A little note for a big day:\n"
    .string "Bag, shoes, courage.\p"
    .string "Save from the START menu before\n"
    .string "taking a break!$"
TH_Text_Console::
    .string "Your favorite adventure game is\n"
    .string "paused. Today, yours begins.$"
TH_Text_TrainerTips::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\n"
    .string "Take your time exploring.\p"
    .string "Talk to people and check signs.\n"
    .string "Little discoveries add up!$"
TH_Text_HomeSign::
    .string "{PLAYER}'s house.\n"
    .string "There's always a place for you.$"
TH_Text_JoeySign::
    .string "JOEY's house.\n"
    .string "Probably out exploring!$"

TH_Text_MomRest::
    .string "MOM: There you are! Let's give\n"
    .string "everyone a little rest.$"

TH_Text_MomRecovery::
    .string "MOM: A rough day, sweetheart?\n"
    .string "You're safe at home now.\p"
    .string "Every adventure has a few\n"
    .string "tumbles. Let's get your partners\p"
    .string "rested.$"

TH_Text_TV::
    .string "Three regions, one research\n"
    .string "exchange! OAK, ELM, and BIRCH\p"
    .string "are working together.\p"
    .string "Their young trainers will\n"
    .string "compare what they discover close\p"
    .string "to home.$"

TH_Text_RobinMorning::
    .string "JOEY: You're late! ...Okay, I'm\n"
    .string "early. I couldn't sleep.\p"
    .string "I kept wondering which one I'd\n"
    .string "pick. Come on! Let's go see OAK.$"

TH_Text_RobinGoLab::
    .string "JOEY: Nine first partners! How\n"
    .string "am I supposed to choose?$"

TH_Text_GateLab::
    .string "OAK is waiting at the lab. Your\n"
    .string "first partner is waiting, too!$"

TH_Text_GateBattle::
    .string "JOEY is waiting outside the lab\n"
    .string "for your first friendly battle.$"

TH_Text_GateSupplies::
    .string "OAK still has your travel\n"
    .string "supplies. Visit the lab before\p"
    .string "heading out.$"

TH_Text_ClosedDoor::
    .string "Nobody's home right now.$"

TH_Text_LabSign::
    .string "PROFESSOR OAK'S LAB Three-Region\n"
    .string "Research Exchange$"

TH_Text_TownSign::
    .string "PALLET TOWN Small beginnings.\n"
    .string "Wide horizons.$"

TH_Text_OakResearch::
    .string "OAK: Good morning, {PLAYER}! A\n"
    .string "special day, isn't it?\p"
    .string "ELM studies how POKéMON grow.\n"
    .string "BIRCH studies the places they\p"
    .string "live.\p"
    .string "We've exchanged first partners\n"
    .string "from KANTO, JOHTO, and HOENN.\p"
    .string "Explore. Learn. Notice the\n"
    .string "little things you might\p"
    .string "otherwise miss.\p"
    .string "Each display holds three\n"
    .string "choices. Take your time meeting\p"
    .string "all nine!$"

TH_Text_ChooseDisplay::
    .string "OAK: Which partner feels right?\n"
    .string "Try a display to see its\p"
    .string "choices.$"

TH_Text_RobinThinking::
    .string "JOEY: I'm going to pick first!\n"
    .string "...After you. I need another\p"
    .string "minute.$"

TH_Text_KantoDisplay::
    .string "KANTO first partners: A familiar\n"
    .string "place to begin.$"

TH_Text_JohtoDisplay::
    .string "JOHTO first partners: Sent with\n"
    .string "care by PROFESSOR ELM.$"

TH_Text_HoennDisplay::
    .string "HOENN first partners: Sent with\n"
    .string "care by PROFESSOR BIRCH.$"

TH_Text_ConfirmPartner::
    .string "Choose {STR_VAR_1} as your first\n"
    .string "partner?$"

TH_Text_ReceivedPartner::
    .string "{PLAYER} received {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
    .string "Your adventure begins together.$"

TH_Text_RobinChoice::
    .string "JOEY: Then I'll choose...\n"
    .string "{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
    .string "I think we'll make a great team.\n"
    .string "Meet me outside when you're\p"
    .string "ready!$"

TH_Text_AlreadyChosen::
    .string "Your first partner is already\n"
    .string "waiting for an adventure with\p"
    .string "you.$"

TH_Text_GrantFailed::
    .string "OAK: Let's check your party\n"
    .string "first. Come speak with me again.$"

TH_Text_Supplies::
    .string "OAK: Take this research\n"
    .string "POKéDEX, five POKé BALLS, and\p"
    .string "two POTIONS.\p"
    .string "The POKéDEX can record partners\n"
    .string "from all three regions.$"

TH_Text_OakSendoff::
    .string "OAK: Travel at your own pace. A\n"
    .string "good question is a fine\p"
    .string "discovery.$"

TH_Text_BagFull::
    .string "OAK: Make a little room in your\n"
    .string "BAG, then talk to me for your\p"
    .string "supplies.$"

TH_Text_BeforeBattle::
    .string "JOEY: Our very first battle!\n"
    .string "Right here, where it all began.\p"
    .string "Ready, {PLAYER}? Let's see what\n"
    .string "our partners can do!$"

TH_Text_BattlePlayerLost::
    .string "JOEY: We did it! That was so\n"
    .string "close!$"

TH_Text_BattlePlayerWon::
    .string "JOEY: Already? You're a\n"
    .string "natural!$"

TH_Text_RobinAfterWin::
    .string "JOEY: I really thought I'd win.\n"
    .string "...But that was brilliant!\p"
    .string "Next time, I'm making you work a\n"
    .string "little harder for it.$"

TH_Text_RobinAfterLoss::
    .string "JOEY: I won! I actually won!\n"
    .string "...Hey, you did well too.\p"
    .string "We'll get better together.\n"
    .string "That's what friends are for,\p"
    .string "right?$"

TH_Text_RobinRoute::
    .string "JOEY: Everyone's feeling better\n"
    .string "now. I'll meet you near\p"
    .string "VIRIDIAN!\p"
    .string "Don't rush past everything.\n"
    .string "We've got a whole first day.$"

TH_Text_CatchHelp::
    .string "Wild POKéMON hide in the grass.\n"
    .string "Weaken one, then try a POKé\p"
    .string "BALL.\p"
    .string "Keep an eye on your partner's\n"
    .string "health. There's no shame in\p"
    .string "heading home.$"

TH_Text_BirdLocal::
    .string "See that HOOTHOOT by the tree? I\n"
    .string "don't usually see them here.\p"
    .string "Maybe it found somewhere it\n"
    .string "likes. It certainly looks\p"
    .string "comfortable.$"

TH_Text_HoothootFirst::
    .string "A HOOTHOOT rests beside the\n"
    .string "tree. One sleepy eye follows\p"
    .string "you.\p"
    .string "It settles back down, quite at\n"
    .string "home. Something to tell OAK\p"
    .string "about someday.$"

TH_Text_HoothootRepeat::
    .string "HOOTHOOT is still resting\n"
    .string "peacefully.$"

TH_Text_Ending::
    .string "JOEY: There you are! We made it\n"
    .string "to VIRIDIAN.\p"
    .string "It's only one route from home...\n"
    .string "So why does everything feel new?\p"
    .string "I'm glad we started together,\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Tomorrow, we can argue about who\n"
    .string "gets to the next town first.$"

TH_Text_DemoComplete::
    .string "THREE HORIZONS - Opening Demo\n"
    .string "Thank you for playing!\p"
    .string "You can SAVE from the menu or\n"
    .string "walk back and explore.\p"
    .string "More of the journey lies ahead.$"

TH_Text_EndingRepeat::
    .string "JOEY: I'll be right here. Take\n"
    .string "another look around if you like.$"

TH_Text_Boundary::
    .string "The rest of VIRIDIAN lies ahead\n"
    .string "in a future demo.\p"
    .string "You can head back to ROUTE 1 and\n"
    .string "PALLET TOWN.$"

